Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 13:36:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] refactor(projects): introduce ProjectRepository
 persistence boundary

- core: ProjectSummary domain model, ProjectRepository interface and
  IsarProjectRepository (delegates to LocalDatabaseService; persisted
  format unchanged).
- app: ProjectProvider depends on ProjectRepository (injectable, Isar by
  default). Isar types no longer reach the UI (dashboard uses
  ProjectSummary).
- Tests for the Isar-to-domain mapping and for ProjectProvider over an
  in-memory repository.
